    "privacy.title": "Privacy Policy",
    "privacy.lastUpdated": "Last updated: September 2026",
    "privacy.collect.title": "What we collect",
    "privacy.collect.body1": "When you create an account: your name, email, password (stored encrypted, we never see it in plain text), phone number, craft type, state, preferred language, and, if you choose to share them, years of experience and a monthly income range. The income range is used only to show you relevant government schemes. We never ask for or store Aadhaar numbers or other government ID numbers.",
    "privacy.collect.body2": "When you use the app: the product names, descriptions, and photos you enter, and the content {{BRAND}}'s AI generates for you (descriptions, captions, messages, photoshoot images). This is saved to your account so you can find it again later. It's never shown to other artisans.",
    "privacy.use.title": "How we use it",
    "privacy.use.body": "To run the app: generate your content, remember your products, and show your usage and progress on the home screen. To personalize: default to your preferred language, and suggest schemes based on what you've shared. We do not sell your data, and we do not use it for advertising.",
    "privacy.cookies.title": "Cookies and tracking",
    "privacy.cookies.body": "{{BRAND}} does not use cookies for tracking or advertising, and we don't run third-party analytics that follow you across other sites. Your login session is kept in your browser's local storage, not a cookie.",
    "privacy.share.title": "Who we share it with",
    "privacy.share.body": "Your product details and prompts are sent to the AI providers that generate your content: Anthropic (Claude), Groq, and Hugging Face. They process this data to return a result and handle it under their own privacy policies. {{BRAND}} does not control their retention practices, but we only send what's needed to generate your content, never your account password, email, or phone number. Your account and content data is stored with Supabase, our database provider. Some of these providers process data on servers outside India. We choose providers with strong security practices, but we can't control the laws of their country the way we can our own.",
    "privacy.rights.title": "Your rights",
    "privacy.rights.intro": "You can view and edit your profile details from the app at any time. You can also:",
    "privacy.rights.item1": "Ask for a copy of everything we hold about you",
    "privacy.rights.item2": "Ask us to correct anything that's wrong",
    "privacy.rights.item3": "Ask us to delete your account and everything in it. We act on deletion requests within 30 days",
    "privacy.rights.item4": "Withdraw your consent at any time by deleting your account or writing to us",
    "privacy.rights.outro": "If something feels wrong, contact us first. If you're not satisfied with our response, you can also complain to India's Data Protection Board under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act.",
    "privacy.retention.title": "How long we keep your data",
    "privacy.retention.body": "We keep your account and content for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, we remove your personal data and content within 30 days, except where the law requires us to keep something longer.",
    "privacy.security.title": "Security",
    "privacy.security.body": "Your data is encrypted in transit (HTTPS). Access to your saved products and content is restricted to your account only, enforced at the database level, not just in the app's interface. If a data breach affecting your personal data ever happens, we'll notify affected users and the relevant authorities as required by law.",
    "privacy.age.title": "Age requirement",
    "privacy.age.body": "{{BRAND}} is built for artisans running a business and is meant for adults. We don't knowingly collect data from anyone under 18. If you believe a child has created an account, contact us and we'll remove it.",
    "privacy.changes.title": "Changes to this policy",
    "privacy.changes.body": "If we make a material change to how we handle your data, we'll notify you in the app before it takes effect.",
    "privacy.contact.title": "Contact",
    "privacy.contact.body": "Questions about this policy or your data:",
    "terms.title": "Terms of Service",
    "terms.lastUpdated": "Last updated: September 2026",
    "terms.what.title": "What {{BRAND}} is",
    "terms.what.body": "{{BRAND}} gives you AI tools to help run your craft business. That includes writing product descriptions and marketing content, generating photoshoot-style images, and offering business guidance. It does not sell your products for you and is not a marketplace.",
    "terms.account.title": "Your account",
    "terms.account.body": "Keep your login details to yourself. You're responsible for activity under your account. Give us accurate information when you sign up. One account per person.",
    "terms.aiContent.title": "AI-generated content",
    "terms.aiContent.body": "Text and images generated by {{BRAND}} are a starting point, not a guarantee. Always review generated content, including product descriptions, pricing suggestions, and especially photoshoot images, before using them commercially. Photoshoot images are AI interpretations styled from your product description. They are not edits of your exact uploaded photo, and colours, patterns, or details may not perfectly match the real product.",
    "terms.ownership.title": "Ownership",
    "terms.ownership.body": "You own the products, photos, and business you upload. You also own the content {{BRAND}} generates for you. We don't claim rights over it and won't use it to promote {{BRAND}} without asking you first.",
    "terms.subscriptions.title": "Subscriptions",
    "terms.subscriptions.body": "Free tier features are available at no cost, with daily usage limits. Paid tiers, when available, are billed monthly or annually as shown at checkout, and can be cancelled anytime. You keep access until the end of the billing period you've already paid for.",
    "terms.prohibited.title": "What you can't do",
    "terms.prohibited.body": "Don't use {{BRAND}} to generate misleading, illegal, or infringing content, impersonate someone else, or try to abuse or overload the AI features (for example, automated bulk requests outside normal use). We can suspend accounts that do.",
    "terms.noGuarantees.title": "No guarantees",
    "terms.noGuarantees.body": "{{BRAND}} is provided as-is. We work to keep it accurate and available, but we don't guarantee the AI's output is error-free, or that the service is uninterrupted. We're not liable for business decisions made solely on AI-generated pricing, descriptions, or content. Always use your own judgement.",
    "terms.changes.title": "Changes",
    "terms.changes.body": "We may update these terms as {{BRAND}} grows. We'll notify you in the app of material changes before they take effect.",
    "terms.governingLaw.title": "Governing law",
    "terms.governingLaw.body": "These terms are governed by the laws of India, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act where it applies to your data.",
    "terms.contact.title": "Contact",
    "terms.contact.body": "Questions about these terms:",
